<!-- On-screen keyboard (CGUIDialogKeyboardGeneric).
     Kodi contract: 311 heading, 312 edit, 313 HZ code label / 314 HZ candidate list (Chinese input;
     Kodi shows/hides 313), key buttons 100-112, 120-132, 140-152, 160-172 (labels and visibility
     set by Kodi per layout), 8 backspace, 32 space, 302 shift, 303 caps lock, 304 symbols,
     305/306 cursor left/right, 300 done, 301 cancel, 307 IP address, 309 voice, 310 layout.
     Key ids and up/down navigation follow Estuary; rows are grouplists so keys a layout
     does not use collapse away. -->
